#: src/ui/o42-window.c:1617
msgid ""
"Type into a cell and press Enter; Tab moves right and Enter goes back\n"
"to the column the row began in.  F2 edits in place, Delete clears,\n"
"Escape cancels.  A formula starts with =, as in =SUM(A1:A9) or\n"
"=Sheet2!B3*2; Shift+F3 lists every function.\n"
"\n"
"Ctrl+C, Ctrl+X, Ctrl+V copy, cut and paste with references moved.\n"
"Ctrl+D and Ctrl+R fill down and right; drag the square at the corner\n"
"of the selection to continue a series.  Ctrl+arrows jump to the edges\n"
"of the data, Ctrl+Home and Ctrl+End to the corners, Shift+Space and\n"
"Ctrl+Space select the row and the column, F5 goes to a cell.\n"
"\n"
"Ctrl+1 is Format Cells, Ctrl+B, Ctrl+I, Ctrl+U bold, italic and\n"
"underline.  Ctrl+F finds, Ctrl+H replaces.  Ctrl+PageUp and\n"
"Ctrl+PageDown move between sheets.  Ctrl+S saves, Ctrl+O opens,\n"
"Ctrl+P prints, Ctrl+Z and Ctrl+Y undo and redo.\n"
"\n"
"Drag a header boundary to resize a column or row, double-click it to\n"
"fit.  Click a picture or chart to select it, drag to move, drag a\n"
"handle to resize, Delete to remove.\n"
"\n"
"A form control from Insert > Control is worked by a plain click;\n"
"Ctrl+click takes hold of it, and Format > Control gives it the cell\n"
"it drives."
msgstr ""
"Ketik di sel lalu tekan Enter; Tab bergerak ke kanan dan Enter kembali\n"
"ke kolom awal baris tersebut.  F2 mengedit di tempat, Delete menghapus,\n"
"Escape membatalkan.  Rumus diawali dengan =, seperti =SUM(A1:A9) atau\n"
"=Sheet2!B3*2; Shift+F3 menampilkan daftar semua fungsi.\n"
"\n"
"Ctrl+C, Ctrl+X, Ctrl+V menyalin, memotong, dan menempel dengan referensi "
"disesuaikan.\n"
"Ctrl+D dan Ctrl+R mengisi ke bawah dan ke kanan; seret kotak di sudut\n"
"pilihan untuk melanjutkan deret.  Ctrl+panah melompat ke tepi\n"
"data, Ctrl+Home dan Ctrl+End ke sudut-sudutnya, Shift+Space dan\n"
"Ctrl+Space memilih baris dan kolom, F5 pergi ke suatu sel.\n"
"\n"
"Ctrl+1 membuka Format Sel; Ctrl+B, Ctrl+I, Ctrl+U untuk tebal, miring, dan\n"
"garis bawah.  Ctrl+F mencari, Ctrl+H mengganti.  Ctrl+PageUp dan\n"
"Ctrl+PageDown berpindah antarlembar.  Ctrl+S menyimpan, Ctrl+O membuka,\n"
"Ctrl+P mencetak, Ctrl+Z dan Ctrl+Y membatalkan dan mengulangi.\n"
"\n"
"Seret batas header untuk mengubah ukuran kolom atau baris, klik ganda untuk\n"
"memaskannya.  Klik gambar atau bagan untuk memilihnya, seret untuk "
"memindahkan,\n"
"seret gagangnya untuk mengubah ukuran, Delete untuk menghapus.\n"
"\n"
"Kontrol formulir dari Sisipkan > Kontrol dijalankan dengan klik biasa;\n"
"Ctrl+klik untuk memegangnya, dan Format > Kontrol memberinya sel\n"
"yang dikendalikannya."

